==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*4 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can actually rush this stage with a few [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercats]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]] alongside two small Freeze [[Cat Combo]]s, completely stunlocking Le'noir and finishing the stage in record time. Be wary of Dark Otter, though, as he can kill your Bombercats in one hit. Try to finish the stage before he spawns.

